        <text x="300" y="65" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#991b1b" font-family="monospace">status == 3</text>
        <text x="205" y="110" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#991b1b">se paga en cada bug y cada reunión</text>

        <text x="570" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#14532d">Con lenguaje ubicuo (este repo)</text>
        <rect x="440" y="40" width="140" height="50" rx="8" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#bbf7d0" />
